Cell["\<\
Each entry in the output is a list contains the dimension of each \
representation in addition to the Dynkin coefficient labeling the \
representation.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->862872836,ExpressionUUID->"03bc8b15-4025-4b8a-88dd-a3b66115b714"],

